    {
      "id": "claim_144b0188b4a242578874cfd0a6bc2cfc",
      "statement": "The observer ID is a random opaque string generated per observer record, deliberately not the user's email, so gatekeeper authors are not tempted to parse identity out of it; identity is conveyed only via the verifier.",
